### DHAAGA BACKEND - FINAL TEST SUITE
### Fill IDs where needed after creating data.
### Use VS Code REST Client or another HTTP client.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@dhaaga.com",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@dhaaga.com",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Public categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Public products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Get cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart

### Get wishlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/wishlist

### Get addresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses

### Get my orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### Get my reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/my

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
